    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: '196px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: '16px', marginTop: '18px' }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: '12px', padding: '20px 20px', justifyContent: 'space-between', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(14,116,144,0.08)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>62.3</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: '10px' }}>12 城全年平均 AQI，整体落在"良"区间——数据有梯度，不是一片绿</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: '12px', padding: '20px 20px', justifyContent: 'space-between', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(14,116,144,0.08)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E7490', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>40.8 / 82.4</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: '10px' }}>深圳最优、郑州最差，首尾相差 2 倍——城市选取确实拉开了梯度</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: '12px', padding: '20px 20px', justifyContent: 'space-between', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(14,116,144,0.08)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B', fontFamily: 'Arial', lineHeight: 1.0 }}>926</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: '10px' }}>O₃ 作为首要污染物的天数超过 PM2.5 的 640 天——夏季臭氧已成主矛盾</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: '12px', padding: '20px 20px', justifyContent: 'space-between', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(14,116,144,0.08)' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E7490', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>六档全覆盖</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: '10px' }}>优 1906 · 良 1950 · 轻度 374 · 中度 59 · 重度 35 · 严重 8 天</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: '40px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>城市空气质量监测看板</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>06 / 07</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
